<mxfile><diagram id="diff" name="diff"><mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="notes" value="WF-06 Demo scenarios: 12 thay đổi. Xanh lá = thêm · Đỏ = xoá · Vàng cam = đổi; phần còn lại làm mờ.&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Create draft report”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm notification “✉ Notify lab head”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm ◉ activity final “Report delivered”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm text “Report delivered”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Report issued, request reported → Report downloaded&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: Lab head → System&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: Lab head → System&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: ● initial node “All results approved” → activity “[report edit permission] Edit the DOCX draft in ONLYOFFICE” → ● initial node “All results approved” → system activity “Create draft report”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Create draft report” → notification “✉ Notify lab head”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm notification “✉ Notify lab head” → activity “[report edit permission] Edit the DOCX draft in ONLYOFFICE”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm notification “✉ Notify customer” → activity “Download report”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: notification “✉ Email report PDF” → activity “Download report” → notification “✉ Email report PDF” → ◉ activity final “Report delivered”" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="3620" height="354" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_l" value="Trước" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="382" width="1770" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_r" value="Sau" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="1870" y="382" width="1770" height="28" as="geom